      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont even know why i'm talking to you. i just messed up something so bad at work. it wasn't just a mistake, it was like... i actually caused people to lose everything. i can't stop seeing their faces. i feel like i'm just a fundamentally broken person now. like there's just this permanent stain on me that's never going away.",
