    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it doesn't feel manageable. it feels like i've fundamentally broken the world for them. you say it's just a \"story\" but some things shouldn't be stories. they should just be gone. i feel like if i'm still here, i'm just continuing to take up space that i don't deserve. like the world would literally be lighter if i wasn't in it anymore.",
